    "summary": "A hanging for the tourist market.  Long and rectangular; ground made of blue tabby cotton cloth; ribbed, black weft.  Nine patterned bands, worked in supplementary weft using white, red and yellow cotton yarns.  All bands different: includes a line of bird motifs, zigzag and diamond patterning, and cross, &#039;X&#039;,  motifs.  Plied fringe with knot at bottom.  Top folded over and stitched to form tube through which bamboo cane is threaded.  Plied cord tied to each end.  Unused.",
